==Skins==
{{Tabber
|Default
|{{SkinGallery
|[[File:Minigun Sentry.png|200px]]
|Black and white quadpod device constructed out of metal, colored black and white.

Has a mounted minigun with red laser to attack enemies.
}}
|Grave Digger
|{{SkinGallery
|[[File:GraveDiggerMinigunSentry.png|200px]]
|Brown and yellow rudimentary armored sentry located in a coffin.

Has a three-barreled minigun on the sentry to attack enemies.
}}
|Plushie
|{{SkinGallery
|[[File:PlushieMinigunSentry.png|200px]]
|Black and white quadpod device constructed out of polyester, colored black and white.

Mounted minigun with a yellow screw to attack enemies.
}}
|Phantom
|{{SkinGallery
|[[File:PhantomMinigunSentry.png|200px]]
|Black and red quadpod device constructed out of metal, colored black and red.

Has a mounted minigun with three red lights to attack enemies.
}}
|Fallen
|{{SkinGallery
|[[File:FallenMinigunSentry.png|200px]]
|Grey orb with a spiked blue tip going through a halo, with the orb that having blue crystal in it.

Blue pedestal that it floats above, with multiple grey spikes and grey top and bottom.
}}
|Dark Frost
|{{SkinGallery
|[[File:DarkFrostMinigunSentry.png|200px]]
|Rifle with an ammo box and a red laser attached to a small yellow vehicle with black tracks and a grey bulldozer blade.

Has purple crystals, which are shaped like spikes covering the bulldozer blade.
}}
|Beach
|{{SkinGallery
|[[File:BeachMinigunSentry.png|200px]]
|Red and white grill with four metal legs.

Small blue and white box to the left.

Has a water Gatling gun inside of it to attack enemies.
}}
|Ghost
|{{SkinGallery
|[[File:GhostMinigunSentry.png|200px]]
|Translucent blue ghost with two black eyes, gloves and shoulder-pads.

Shoots beams from its hands.
}}
|Springtime
|{{SkinGallery
|[[File:SpringtimeMinigunSentry.png|200px]]
|Green crystal floating above a wooden structure which is surrounded by vines with flowers.

Fires beams from the crystal at enemies.
}}
|Bunny
|{{SkinGallery
|[[File:BunnyMinigunSentry.png|200px]]
|Brown, orange and grey quadpod device constructed out of metal with many flowers on the sides.

Has a mounted minigun with yellow laser to attack enemies.
}}
|Scuba Ops
|{{SkinGallery
|[[File:ScubaOpsMinigunSentry.png|200px]]
|Blue, orange and grey underwater drone with two propellers.

Has a gatling gun to attack enemies.
}}
}}

