==Update History==
{{scroll|text =
*'''17 April 2022''' - [[v1.2.0]]
**'''Minigun Sentry''' added.
**{{Bug}} Has no recoil animation.
*'''31 October 2023''' - [[v1.9.0]]
**New skin: {{Color|Lunar|Grave Digger}}
*'''24 November 2023''' - [[v1.9.4]]
**New skin: {{Color|Other|Plushie}}
*'''21 December 2023''' - [[v1.11.0]]
**New skin: {{Color|Phantom|Phantom}}
*'''21 August 2024''' - [[v1.28.0]]
**New skin: {{Color|FallenMission|Fallen}}
*'''11 December 2024''' - [[v1.45.0]]
**{{Bug}} Skins are not always applied and the Default skin is used instead.
*'''16 December 2024''' - [[v1.46.0]]
**New skin: {{Color|OperationICE|Dark Frost}}
**{{Bug}} {{Color|OperationICE|Dark Frost}} skin has collision.
**{{Bug}} {{Color|OperationICE|Dark Frost}} skin has its muzzle flash inside the muzzle.
**{{Bugfix}} '''Minigun Sentry''' now uses its skins.
*'''20 December 2024''' - [[v1.47.0]]
**{{Bug}} {{Color|OperationICE|Dark Frost}} skin uses Default skin models.
*'''20 December 2024''' - [[v1.47.0|v1.47.1]]
**{{Bugfix}} {{Color|OperationICE|Dark Frost}} now has custom models again.
*'''8 January 2024''' - [[v1.48.0|v1.48.1a]]
**{{Bugfix}} {{Color|OperationICE|Dark Frost}} skin can no longer collide with players.
*'''16 April 2025''' - [[v1.61.0]]
**{{Bug}} Default skin no longer has a muzzle flash.
*'''9 July 2025''' - [[v1.70.0]]
**New skin: {{Color|Surf|Beach}}
*'''9 July 2025''' - [[v1.70.0]]
**New skin: {{Color|Surf|Beach}}
**{{Bug}} No longer moves back when firing.
**{{Bug}} {{Color|FallenMission|Fallen}} skin no longer fires purple beams.
*'''18 October 2025''' - [[v1.77.0]]
**New skin: {{Color|Null|Ghost}}
**{{Bug}} {{Color|Null|Ghost}} skin animations break once a new sentry is made.
**{{Bug}} {{Color|Null|Ghost}} skin is not affected by [[Time Scale]].
*'''21 October 2025''' - [[v1.77.0|v1.77.5]]
**{{Bugfix}} {{Color|Null|Ghost}} skin animations now work properly.
*'''11 March 2026''' - [[v1.86.0]]
**New skin: {{Color|Shamrock|Springtime}}
*'''3 April 2026''' - [[v1.88.0]]
**New skin: {{Color|SpringFrenzy|Bunny}}
*'''2 July 2026''' - [[v2.1.0|v2.1.7]]
**New skin: {{Color|Scuba|Scuba Ops}}
}}



